## ۴. API Endpoints

```
# Connections
POST   /api/connections                    ایجاد اتصال جدید
GET    /api/connections                    لیست اتصال‌ها
GET    /api/connections/:id                جزئیات اتصال
DELETE /api/connections/:id                حذف اتصال
POST   /api/connections/:id/test           تست connection

# Sync
POST   /api/connections/:id/sync           شروع Sync
GET    /api/sync/jobs/:id                  وضعیت Job
GET    /api/sync/logs                      تاریخچه Sync
POST   /api/sync/jobs/:id/rollback         بازگشت Sync

# Webhook (public — no auth)
POST   /api/webhook/woocommerce            دریافت از WooCommerce
POST   /api/webhook/shopify                دریافت از Shopify
POST   /api/webhook/custom/:connectionId   دریافت از Custom API

# Mapping
GET    /api/connections/:id/mapping        لیست مپینگ‌ها
POST   /api/connections/:id/mapping/bulk   تطبیق گروهی

# Rules
GET    /api/connections/:id/rules          لیست قوانین
POST   /api/connections/:id/rules          ایجاد قانون

# Health
GET    /api/connections/:id/health         وضعیت سلامت
```

